PE 815: Group by Value / 点数分组

=== Problem Summary ===
4n cards, n values, 4 cards each.
Deal cards, group by value. Remove pile when 4 complete.
E(n) = expected maximum number of simultaneous piles.

=== Verify E(2) = 1.97142857 ===
  E(2) = 1.97142857 (expected 1.97142857) ✓

=== Combinatorial analysis ===
  For n=2 (8 cards): 70 distinct sequences.
  Max piles can be 1 or 2.
  P(max=2) = 68/70 ≈ 0.97142857
  P(max=1) = 2/70 ≈ 0.02857143
  E(2) = 1*2/70 + 2*68/70 = 138/70 = 1.97142857 ✓

=== PE Answer ===
  E(60) = 54.12691621
